WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.550 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  it's that time of the month again the  playstation plus games have officially  been announced for april 2022. all ps  plus subscribers can download the  following games from tuesday april 5th  by the way i'll be breaking down the  changes to ps plus in a video later in  the month because today it's all about  the games let's do this first up on both  ps4 and ps5 here's hud outlaws and  legends released only 10 months ago this  is best described as a stealth action  heist set in medieval times we are  effectively robin hood a team of four  outlaws attempt to break into a heavily  guarded outpost to steal gold all the  guards are ai controlled and won't  bother you too much and that's where the  game pivots because another team of four  outlaw players want that loot two the  match is broken into three stages  locating the key to get inside which is  found on a randomly generated minibus  stage two is opening the vault and  claiming the loot inside and finally  stage three is running all the way back  to safety sounds simple right well at  any point the other team of players can  attack your squad making the last 10  minutes of each game a complete  bloodbath there are a handful of classes  to choose from including a ranged archer  a tank-like brawler who can carry the  chest much quicker than anyone else a  mystical healer and a huntress who can  turn invisible briefly more classes have  been added since then including the  sellsword ida on release there simply  was not enough content to keep the  audience playing which is likely why ps  plus is here to try and resurrect the  game hood outlaws and legends scores  average out at 6.5 out of 10 so i guess  we officially call this an ok game over  to the ps4 now we have spongebob  squarepants battle for bikini bottom  rehydrated that's a long title this is  billed as a complete remake of the  beloved original from back in the ps2  days but realistically it's more of a  remaster as it certainly still feels  like a game stuck in 2003. as you can  see battle for bikini bottom is a  platformer which allows us to switch  between three playable characters  spongebob patrick and sandy you'll need  those characters to solve different  puzzles as they each have different  abilities to utilize the campaign will  take the average player between 8 and 10  hours to complete and if you're looking  for an easy platinum trophy you'll have  it done in about 15 hours in total in  terms of difficulty spongebob  squarepants battle for bikini bottom  rehydrated is aimed at kids but if you  like the show it's worth a nostalgia hit  too average scores tells this is a six  out of ten game three is slayed aspire  and let me promise you it's way better  than any video footage can show you this  game regularly gets nine out of ten  review scores slay the spire is a card  based roguelike let me explain we are  tasked with climbing up a spire we are  given a basic stack of cards and use  them in battles with random beasts and  monsters each victory gifts us a new  card which then shapes our deck for the  next battle over time you'll learn which  cards work well together it's all about  synergy and once you've perfected one  deck there's another three character  types to go through from straight up  damage builds to in-depth orb mechanics  which makes no sense unless you've  played the game let me put another way  if you enjoy gwent hearthstone and other  deck building games give this a try it  may not look impressive but it's crazy  addictive and game 4 is a reminder that  gta online is free to ps plus  subscribers who have a ps5 right now you  have until june 14th to add it to your  library to keep it forever if you  haven't ventured into los santos for a  few years going back is quite impressive  i've just returned to the game there is  a ton of things to do unless you're in a  lobby with human turds who dive bomb you  at every opportunity so much fun so  that's your bag for april 2022 let me  know your thoughts in the comments and  what you're playing this month i'm adam  you're awesome i'll see you next time  [Music]

